{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 3, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "  skl    skylake        Intel Skylake/Kaby/Coffee Lake client core (this host's i5-9400 is one): AVX2, no AVX-512\n  skx    skylake-x      Intel Skylake-SP/X server core: AVX-512 F/CD/BW/DQ/VL, two 512-bit FMA units (ports 0+1 fused, 5)\n  glc    goldencove     Intel Golden Cove P-core as in Sapphire Rapids: AVX-512 with VBMI, VPOPCNTDQ, BITALG, GFNI\n  rpl    raptorlake     Intel Raptor Lake / Alder Lake P-core (Golden Cove/Raptor Cove): Golden Cove costs, AVX-512 fused off; GFNI, VAES and VPCLMULQDQ on xmm/ymm\n  zen4   znver4         AMD Zen 4: AVX-512 (VBMI, VPOPCNTDQ, BITALG, GFNI) on 256-bit pipes, 512-bit ops double-pumped\n  x86v2  x86-64-v2      generic x86-64-v2 (SSE4.2, POPCNT): the worst of Skylake, Golden Cove and Zen 4 per class\n  x86v3  x86-64-v3      generic x86-64-v3 (AVX2, FMA, BMI1/2, LZCNT, MOVBE): the worst of Skylake, Golden Cove and Zen 4\n  x86v4  x86-64-v4      generic x86-64-v4 (AVX-512 F/BW/CD/DQ/VL): the worst of Skylake-X, Golden Cove and Zen 4\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 3, "ok": true, "cmd": "x86_models", "ucas": "x86 models", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "x86_models", "models": [{"model": "skl", "alias": "skylake", "description": "Intel Skylake/Kaby/Coffee Lake client core (this host's i5-9400 is one): AVX2, no AVX-512"}, {"model": "skx", "alias": "skylake-x", "description": "Intel Skylake-SP/X server core: AVX-512 F/CD/BW/DQ/VL, two 512-bit FMA units (ports 0+1 fused, 5)"}, {"model": "glc", "alias": "goldencove", "description": "Intel Golden Cove P-core as in Sapphire Rapids: AVX-512 with VBMI, VPOPCNTDQ, BITALG, GFNI"}, {"model": "rpl", "alias": "raptorlake", "description": "Intel Raptor Lake / Alder Lake P-core (Golden Cove/Raptor Cove): Golden Cove costs, AVX-512 fused off; GFNI, VAES and VPCLMULQDQ on xmm/ymm"}, {"model": "zen4", "alias": "znver4", "description": "AMD Zen 4: AVX-512 (VBMI, VPOPCNTDQ, BITALG, GFNI) on 256-bit pipes, 512-b